    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left left\"><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, for function to be continuous,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, differentiating and putting the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>,</p><p> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+